== 7. Fixes the whole run asked for (all inside the lane paths)
- The cache-buster bump (app.js and styles.css, index.html) leaves older staging suites naming the old version (VTID-04696). Replaced the
  old version token in the 30 staging-tests.json files that name it, 68 tokens, as the VTID-05082 bump did.
  $ git show HEAD:<file> compared with <file> after putting the old token back: 30 of 30 identical (outputs/asset-bump-follow.txt)
- VTID-05073 (b) pins the set of top-level function names of the Command Hub bundle against a frozen fixture. loadDeliveryScreen and
  renderDeliveryView became one object, "var deliveryModule = {...}" (no top-level function declaration). Three behaviour tests for the
  loader were added (one script element, reuse, retry after an error) and six mutations.
- VTID-04814: the voice screens and the stored vectors are outside the paths and need an AWS call. Tried the three screen entries and the
  ownership-guard line temporarily to see the effect, saved them as outputs/outside-lane-paths.patch, and reverted both files
  (git checkout -- <the two files>). The commit contains neither file.
- A test run rewrites specs/command-hub-symbol-index.json as a side effect; it was restored with git checkout after every run.

